$ moolah init --base ILS --no-backup-key
Book "main" is ready in $TMP/data/books/main.db (base currency ILS).
Next: add your accounts, for example:
  moolah account add Checking --kind bank --currency ILS --opening 1000
  moolah category list

$ moolah account add leumi --kind bank --currency ILS
Added account leumi (ILS).

$ moolah import $TMP/card.csv --account leumi
Imported $TMP/card.csv into leumi with profile generic-csv: 3 new.
Import ID 1 (undo with: moolah import undo 1).
3 rows have no category yet. Give them one with: moolah review

$ moolah review    # answers: subscriptions | y | N |  | y | q
Type a category or account name for each transaction. ? = list them, Enter = skip, q = quit.

